# BUG-005 — Search Does Not Display No-Results Message

## Bug Type
Functional / UI

## Module
Search

## Severity
Medium

## Priority
Medium

## Steps to Reproduce
1. Open the E-Commerce website.
2. Click the Search field.
3. Enter a product name that does not exist.
4. Click Search.

## Expected Result
A clear message such as "No products found" should be displayed.

## Actual Result
No clear feedback is provided to the user.

